# Build context hygiene for auth-service/Dockerfile and order-service/Dockerfile.
#
# The image builds copy whole module trees. Without this file the host's own
# `target/` directories enter the context, and a build could silently inherit
# artifacts the host produced — which is exactly the clean-state guarantee
# FR-018 exists to make. Keeping them out is part of that guarantee, not a
# build-speed optimisation.
target/
*/target/
*.class

# Never let signing material reach a build context.
keys/
*.pem
*.p12
.env
k8s-lab/.certs/
k8s-lab/results/

# Frontend and tooling the service images have no use for.
node_modules/
hydra-ui/
dist/
build/
coverage/
storybook-static/

# VCS and IDE
.git/
.github/
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml

# Docs and specs — not build inputs.
specs/
*.md
!README.md

.DS_Store
*.log
